AHS.TeachingMaterialContentStore["tm_108"] = {"summary":{"materialId":"tm_108","coreConcepts":["2-1｜氣體的通性：高膨脹率、高壓縮性、互溶性、高擴散性。氣體體積是粒子的運動空間，也就是容器體積","2-1｜壓力單位：1 atm ＝ 76 cmHg ＝ 760 mmHg ＝ 760 torr ＝ 1.013×10⁵ Pa ＝ 1013 hPa ＝ 1.013 bar ＝ 1033.6 cmH₂O","2-1｜壓力計：開口式 P氣 ＝ P大氣 ± h（氣體端液面較低用＋，較高用－）；閉口式 P氣 ＝ h，與大氣壓無關；P ＝ d × h，非水銀液柱要換成汞柱","2-1｜溫度與動能：T(K) ＝ t(°C) ＋ 273；平均動能 Ēₖ ＝ (3/2)RT，只與溫度有關；同溫下分子量愈小，運動速率愈快","2-2｜波以耳定律（n、T 固定）：P₁V₁ ＝ P₂V₂，P 與 V 成反比","2-2｜查理定律（n、P 固定）：V₁/T₁ ＝ V₂/T₂，V 與絕對溫度成正比；溫度每變化 1°C，體積變化 0°C 時體積的 1/273.15","2-2｜亞佛加厥定律（P、T 固定）：V₁/n₁ ＝ V₂/n₂；同溫同壓同體積的氣體分子數相同；重量比、密度比都等於分子量比；STP 莫耳體積 22.4 L，NTP 24.5 L","2-2｜定容下壓力與溫度（講義未列專節，由 PV ＝ nRT 推得）：n、V 固定時 P₁/T₁ ＝ P₂/T₂","2-3｜理想氣體方程式 PV ＝ nRT；R ＝ 0.082 atm·L/(mol·K) ＝ 62.4 mmHg·L/(mol·K) ＝ 8.31 J/(mol·K)；求分子量 M ＝ WRT/(PV)，密度式 PM ＝ dRT","2-3｜理想氣體與真實氣體：理想氣體粒子體積為 0、粒子間無作用力、不會液化；真實氣體在低壓、高溫、分子量小時最接近理想氣體，He 最接近","2-4｜道耳頓分壓定律：定溫定容、混合時不反應，P_t ＝ P₁ ＋ P₂ ＋ …；若會反應，先算反應後剩餘的氣體","2-4｜莫耳分率 Xᵢ ＝ nᵢ/n_t，總和為 1；分壓 Pᵢ ＝ P_t × Xᵢ；分壓比 ＝ 莫耳數比；平均分子量 M̄ ＝ ΣMᵢXᵢ ＝ dRT/P_t","2-4｜飽和蒸氣壓：蒸發速率等於凝結速率時蒸氣的壓力，只隨溫度升高而變大（正相關，非正比），與容器體積、液體量無關；水在 100°C 時為 760 mmHg","2-4｜排水集氣壓力校正：水面等高 P氣 ＝ P大氣 － P水蒸氣；瓶外水面較高 P氣 ＝ P大氣 ＋ h/13.6 － P水蒸氣；瓶內水面較高 P氣 ＝ P大氣 － h/13.6 － P水蒸氣"],"definitions":["壓力：單位面積所受的垂直作用力","絕對零度：0 K ＝ −273.15°C，理論上最低的溫度","莫耳體積：1 莫耳物質所占的空間","理想氣體：同時符合波以耳、查理、亞佛加厥定律，完全遵守 PV ＝ nRT 的氣體","分壓：混合氣體中某成分單獨存在於同一容器時呈現的壓力","膨脹率 ＝ (T₂ − T₁)/T₁；逸出率 ＝ (T₂ − T₁)/T₂（定壓下，分母不同）","壓縮因子 Z ＝ PV/nRT：理想氣體 Z ＝ 1，真實氣體 Z ≠ 1"],"pitfalls":["E01 攝氏溫度直接代入氣體定律（應先換成 K）","E02 用 R ＝ 0.082 時，壓力留在 mmHg 或體積留在 mL（應換成 atm、L）","E03 混淆總質量 W 與密度 d，選錯公式","E04 反應式未配平，或把質量比當成係數比；忽略水是液態還是氣態","E05 連通容器直接把初始壓力相加或平均（應算 ΣPᵢVᵢ ÷ 總體積）；忘了處理 NH₃＋HCl 等反應","E06 把莫耳分率當成質量分率；平均分子量直接算術平均","E07 排水集氣忘記扣水蒸氣壓、水柱沒有除以 13.6，或液面高低的加減方向弄反","E08 沒看清楚座標軸和固定條件；把攝氏溫度的直線當成過原點","亞佛加厥定律說的是分子數，不是原子數；比較原子數要再乘上每分子的原子數","膨脹率與逸出率的分母不同，不可混用","飽和蒸氣壓與溫度是正相關，不是正比"],"memorize":["固定流程｜單一氣體：列已知與所求 → 統一單位 → 溫度轉 K → 選公式 → 代入 → 寫單位 → 回代驗算","固定流程｜混合氣體：求各氣體的 n（同溫時可用 PV 代替）→ 會反應先扣除 → 加總 → 求總體積與共同狀態 → 總壓 → 分壓","固定流程｜排水集氣：判斷水面高低 → 水柱除以 13.6 換成汞柱 → 修正總壓 → 查該溫度的水蒸氣壓 → 扣除","固定流程｜圖形題：先看縱軸、橫軸和單位 → 圈出固定量 → 判斷正比、反比或水平線；V 對 t(°C) 不過原點，V 對 T(K) 才過原點","題目給總質量 W 用 M ＝ WRT/(PV)，給密度 d 用 PM ＝ dRT","定溫定容下分壓比等於莫耳數比，反應題可以直接用分壓計算反應量","第一次段考化學第 2 章考到壓力與壓力計，非水銀液柱換算出現多次；2-2 之後是接下來的複習重點"],"reviewSuggestions":["先默寫：三大定律及固定條件、PV ＝ nRT、R 與單位配對、Pᵢ ＝ P_t Xᵢ、排水集氣壓力校正","做本教材 28 題易錯題型練習，答錯的題目回到 tm_28 找同型的講義原題再做一次","用自己的話說明每一題固定了哪個量，並畫出 P-V、V-T、P-T 關係圖","公式題依 1 天、3 天、7 天、考前的間隔複習"],"subject":"化學","grade":"高二","chapter":"第二章：氣體（考前總複習：2-1～2-4 重點、易錯題型與解題流程）","section":"總複習（對照講義第45～101頁；易錯題型練習 28 題）","title":"第二章：氣體（考前總複習：2-1～2-4 重點、易錯題型與解題流程） 總複習（對照講義第45～101頁；易錯題型練習 28 題）"},"questions":[{"id":"tm_108_q1","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"定壓下，定量氣體在 27°C 時體積為 600 mL，加熱到 127°C 時體積為多少 mL？","options":["800","2822","450","1200"],"answer":"800","explanation":"T₁ = 300 K、T₂ = 400 K，V₂ = 600 × 400/300 = 800 mL。若直接代攝氏溫度，會算出 600 × 127/27 ≈ 2822 mL，這是最常見的錯誤。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":61,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"查理定律","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體的基本定律","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E01 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q2","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"定容鋼瓶在 7°C 時壓力為 14 atm，升溫到 77°C 時壓力為多少 atm？","options":["17.5","154","11.2","16.1"],"answer":"17.5","explanation":"定量、定容時 P 與絕對溫度成正比：T₁ = 280 K、T₂ = 350 K，P₂ = 14 × 350/280 = 17.5 atm。講義未列專節，由 PV = nRT 令 n、V 固定即得。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":71,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"定容下壓力與溫度","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體的基本定律","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E01 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q3","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"3","type":"single_choice","question":"1.64 L 的容器內有 0.10 mol 氣體，溫度 27°C，容器內壓力為多少 mmHg？","options":["1140","1.5","866","2.28"],"answer":"1140","explanation":"P = nRT/V = 0.10 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 1.64 = 1.5 atm。題目問 mmHg，要再乘 760：1.5 × 760 = 1140 mmHg。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":71,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式","difficulty":"易","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E02 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q4","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"4","type":"single_choice","question":"127°C、380 mmHg 下，250 mL 氣體有多少莫耳？","options":["3.81×10⁻³","3.81","2.90","1.16×10⁻⁴"],"answer":"3.81×10⁻³","explanation":"R = 0.082 時 P 用 atm、V 用 L：P = 380/760 = 0.50 atm，V = 0.25 L，T = 400 K，n = 0.50 × 0.25 ÷ (0.082 × 400) ≈ 3.81×10⁻³ mol。V 忘記換成 L 會得 3.81；P 忘記換成 atm 會得 2.90。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":71,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式","difficulty":"中","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E02 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q5","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"5","type":"single_choice","question":"127°C、0.82 atm 下，某氣體的密度為 1.4 g/L，此氣體的分子量為多少？","options":["56","17.8","28","1.4"],"answer":"56","explanation":"PM = dRT：M = 1.4 × 0.082 × 400 ÷ 0.82 = 56。把 127 直接當溫度代入會得 17.8。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":74,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式求分子量","difficulty":"易","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E03 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q6","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"6","type":"single_choice","question":"27°C、1.0 atm 下，0.60 g 某氣體的體積為 246 mL，此氣體的分子量為多少？","options":["60","0.060","5.4","30"],"answer":"60","explanation":"這題給總質量 W，用 M = WRT/(PV)：0.60 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ (1.0 × 0.246) = 60。V 代 246 會得 0.060；溫度代 27 會得 5.4。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":74,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式求分子量","difficulty":"中","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E03 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q7","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"7","type":"single_choice","question":"定溫定壓下，40 mL H₂ 與 30 mL O₂ 混合，依 2H₂ + O₂ → 2H₂O 完全反應，且生成的水全為氣態。反應後氣體總體積為多少 mL？","options":["50","70","40","10"],"answer":"50","explanation":"同溫同壓下係數比 = 體積比。40 mL H₂ 用掉 20 mL O₂，剩 O₂ 10 mL，生成 H₂O(g) 40 mL，共 50 mL。若水是液態，氣體就只剩 10 mL，所以要看清楚水的狀態。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":84,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"混合時發生反應","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E04 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q8","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"8","type":"single_choice","question":"定溫定容的密閉容器中有 CO 4.0 atm 與 O₂ 3.0 atm，依 2CO + O₂ → 2CO₂ 完全反應後，容器總壓為多少 atm？","options":["5.0","7.0","4.0","6.0"],"answer":"5.0","explanation":"定溫定容下分壓比 = 莫耳數比，可以直接用分壓算反應量：CO 4.0 atm 用掉 O₂ 2.0 atm，生成 CO₂ 4.0 atm，剩 O₂ 1.0 atm，總壓 5.0 atm。7.0 是沒有處理反應、直接相加的結果。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":84,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"混合時發生反應","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E04 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q9","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"9","type":"single_choice","question":"0.48 g 鎂與過量鹽酸反應：Mg + 2HCl → MgCl₂ + H₂。在 27°C、1.0 atm 下生成的氫氣體積為多少 mL？（Mg = 24）","options":["492","984","246","448"],"answer":"492","explanation":"n(Mg) = 0.48/24 = 0.020 mol，Mg 與 H₂ 的係數比 1：1，n(H₂) = 0.020 mol，V = nRT/P = 0.020 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 1.0 = 0.492 L。把 HCl 的係數 2 算進去會得 984；448 是用 STP 的 22.4 L/mol 算的，但題目不是 0°C。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":74,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式與反應計量","difficulty":"中","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E04 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q10","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"10","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫下，2.0 L、3.0 atm 的 He 與 3.0 L、2.0 atm 的 Ne 以體積可忽略的細管連通，平衡後總壓為多少 atm？","options":["2.4","5.0","2.5","1.2"],"answer":"2.4","explanation":"同溫下 n 與 PV 成正比：總壓 = (2.0 × 3.0 + 3.0 × 2.0) ÷ (2.0 + 3.0) = 12 ÷ 5.0 = 2.4 atm。初始壓力相加得 5.0、取平均得 2.5，都沒有考慮體積。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":87,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"分壓定律（混合）","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E05 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q11","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"11","type":"single_choice","question":"27°C 時，4.0 L、1.0 atm 的 N₂ 與 2.0 L、4.0 atm 的 O₂ 連通（細管體積可忽略），再將整個系統加熱到 127°C。平衡後總壓為多少 atm？","options":["2.67","2.0","5.0","6.67"],"answer":"2.67","explanation":"先在 27°C 混合：P = (4.0 × 1.0 + 2.0 × 4.0) ÷ 6.0 = 2.0 atm。再定容加熱：P = 2.0 × 400/300 ≈ 2.67 atm。溫度要用 K，體積要用總體積。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":87,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"氣體定律綜合","difficulty":"難","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E05 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q12","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"12","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫下，3.0 L、2.0 atm 的 NH₃ 與 1.0 L、2.0 atm 的 HCl 連通，兩者反應生成固體 NH₄Cl（固體體積可忽略）。平衡後容器內壓力為多少 atm？","options":["1.0","2.0","1.5","0.5"],"answer":"1.0","explanation":"n 與 PV 成正比：NH₃ 6.0、HCl 2.0（atm·L）。反應係數 1：1，HCl 用完，剩 NH₃ 4.0，總體積 4.0 L，P = 1.0 atm。2.0 是忘了反應的結果。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":84,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"混合時發生反應","difficulty":"難","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E05 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q13","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"13","type":"single_choice","question":"混合氣體含 8.0 g He 與 32.0 g O₂，總壓 9.0 atm，He 的分壓為多少 atm？（He = 4、O = 16）","options":["6.0","1.8","4.5","7.2"],"answer":"6.0","explanation":"n(He) = 2.0 mol、n(O₂) = 1.0 mol，X(He) = 2/3，P(He) = 9.0 × 2/3 = 6.0 atm。用質量分率 8/40 計算會得 1.8，這是把莫耳分率當成質量分率。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":85,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"莫耳分率與分壓","difficulty":"易","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E06 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q14","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"14","type":"single_choice","question":"某混合氣體由 N₂ 與 O₂ 組成，莫耳分率分別為 0.75 與 0.25，其平均分子量為多少？","options":["29","30","31","60"],"answer":"29","explanation":"M̄ = ΣMᵢXᵢ = 28 × 0.75 + 32 × 0.25 = 29。兩個分子量直接平均是 30，不對。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":85,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"平均分子量","difficulty":"易","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E06 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q15","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"15","type":"single_choice","question":"CH₄ 與 O₂ 的混合氣體在 27°C、0.82 atm 下，密度為 1.0 g/L，混合氣體中 CH₄ 的莫耳分率為多少？","options":["0.125","0.875","0.25","0.50"],"answer":"0.125","explanation":"M̄ = dRT/P = 1.0 × 0.082 × 300 ÷ 0.82 = 30。設 CH₄ 的莫耳分率為 x：16x + 32(1 − x) = 30，x = 0.125。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":85,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"平均分子量與分壓","difficulty":"難","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E06 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q16","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"16","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】定溫下，一密閉剛性容器內有 N₂ 與 O₂。再充入少量不反應的 He（容器體積不變），下列哪些正確？","options":["(A) 總壓變大","(B) N₂ 的分壓不變","(C) N₂ 的莫耳分率不變","(D) O₂ 的莫耳分率變小","(E) N₂ 與 O₂ 的分壓比不變"],"answer":"(A)(B)(D)(E)","explanation":"定溫定容充入 He：總莫耳數增加，總壓變大，(A) 對。N₂、O₂ 的莫耳數與體積、溫度都沒變，分壓不變，(B)(E) 對。總莫耳數變大，N₂、O₂ 的莫耳分率都變小，(C) 錯、(D) 對。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":83,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"道耳頓分壓定律","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E06 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q17","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"17","type":"single_choice","question":"27°C、大氣壓力 755 mmHg 下，以排水集氣法收集氧氣 300 mL，瓶內外水面等高。乾燥氧氣在 STP 下的體積約為多少 mL？（27°C 水的飽和蒸氣壓 25 mmHg）","options":["262","271","288","300"],"answer":"262","explanation":"水面等高：P(O₂) = 755 − 25 = 730 mmHg。換到 STP：V = 300 × (730/760) × (273/300) ≈ 262 mL。沒扣水蒸氣壓會得 271。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":89,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E07 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q18","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"18","type":"single_choice","question":"20°C、大氣壓力 760 mmHg 下以排水集氣法收集氫氣，瓶內水面比瓶外高 27.2 cm。乾燥氫氣的壓力為多少 mmHg？（20°C 水的飽和蒸氣壓 17.5 mmHg；水銀密度 13.6 g/cm³）","options":["722.5","762.5","742.5","470.5"],"answer":"722.5","explanation":"水柱先換成汞柱：272 mm ÷ 13.6 = 20 mmHg。瓶內水面較高，同一水平面：P大氣 = P氫 + P水蒸氣 + 20，所以 P氫 = 760 − 20 − 17.5 = 722.5 mmHg。沒有除以 13.6 會得 470.5；加減方向錯會得 762.5。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":89,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E07 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q19","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"19","type":"single_choice","question":"25°C、大氣壓力 750 mmHg 下以排水集氣法收集氣體，瓶外水面比瓶內高 13.6 cm。乾燥氣體的壓力為多少 mmHg？（25°C 水的飽和蒸氣壓 23.8 mmHg；水銀密度 13.6 g/cm³）","options":["736.2","716.2","726.2","760.0"],"answer":"736.2","explanation":"136 mm ÷ 13.6 = 10 mmHg。瓶外水面較高，瓶內壓力比大氣壓大：P總 = 750 + 10 = 760 mmHg，再扣水蒸氣壓：760 − 23.8 = 736.2 mmHg。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":89,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"排水集氣法的壓力校正","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E07 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q20","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"20","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】定溫下，一密閉容器內有液態水與水蒸氣達成平衡，下列哪些正確？","options":["(A) 水的蒸發速率等於水蒸氣的凝結速率","(B) 將容器體積壓縮後再達平衡，水的飽和蒸氣壓變大","(C) 容器內液態水加倍，水的飽和蒸氣壓不變","(D) 升高溫度，水的飽和蒸氣壓變大","(E) 水的飽和蒸氣壓與溫度成正比"],"answer":"(A)(C)(D)","explanation":"達平衡時蒸發與凝結速率相等，(A) 對。飽和蒸氣壓只隨溫度改變，與容器體積、液體量無關，(B) 錯、(C) 對。溫度升高蒸氣壓變大，(D) 對；但只是正相關，不是正比，(E) 錯。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":89,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"飽和蒸氣壓","difficulty":"中","section":"2-4 氣體的分壓","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E07 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q21","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"21","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】定量理想氣體，下列哪些關係圖是「通過原點的直線」？","options":["(A) 定溫：P 對 1/V","(B) 定壓：V 對 t（°C）","(C) 定容：P 對 T（K）","(D) 定溫：PV 對 P","(E) 定壓：V 對 T（K）"],"answer":"(A)(C)(E)","explanation":"(A) P 與 1/V 成正比，(C)(E) 都與絕對溫度成正比，三者都過原點。(B) 用攝氏溫度時，直線與橫軸相交在約 −273°C，不過原點。(D) 定溫下 PV 為定值，是水平線。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":76,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"氣體定律（圖形）","difficulty":"中","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E08 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q22","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"22","type":"single_choice","question":"1 mol 理想氣體在 2.0 atm 下，以體積 V（L）對絕對溫度 T（K）作圖，得一通過原點的直線，其斜率約為多少？","options":["0.041","0.082","0.164","12.3"],"answer":"0.041","explanation":"V = (nR/P)T，斜率 = nR/P = 1 × 0.082 ÷ 2.0 = 0.041。12.3 是 300 K 時的體積，不是斜率。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":76,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體方程式（圖形）","difficulty":"中","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 易錯題型 E08 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q23","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"23","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫同壓下，某氣體的密度是氧氣的 1.5 倍，此氣體的分子量為多少？","options":["48","21.3","32","64"],"answer":"48","explanation":"同溫同壓下，密度比 = 分子量比（亞佛加厥定律的應用）：M = 32 × 1.5 = 48。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":65,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"易","section":"2-2 氣體的基本定律","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 補充單元 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q24","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"24","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫同壓下，含有相同數目氧原子的 O₂ 與 O₃，體積比（O₂：O₃）為多少？","options":["3：2","2：3","1：1","1：3"],"answer":"3：2","explanation":"氧原子數相同時，O₂ 與 O₃ 的分子數比為 1/2：1/3 = 3：2。同溫同壓下體積比 = 分子數比，所以是 3：2。亞佛加厥定律說的是分子數，不是原子數。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":65,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"亞佛加厥定律","difficulty":"中","section":"2-2 氣體的基本定律","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 補充單元 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q25","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"25","type":"single_choice","question":"下列哪一種狀況的氣體最接近理想氣體？","options":["He，500 K，0.5 atm","He，100 K，50 atm","CO₂，500 K，0.5 atm","CO₂，250 K，50 atm"],"answer":"He，500 K，0.5 atm","explanation":"低壓、高溫、分子量小（分子間引力小）時最接近理想氣體。He 是引力最小的氣體，再配上高溫低壓，最接近。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":72,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體與真實氣體","difficulty":"易","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 補充單元 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q26","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"26","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】關於理想氣體與真實氣體，下列哪些正確？","options":["(A) 理想氣體的粒子本身體積視為 0","(B) 理想氣體加壓降溫可以液化","(C) 真實氣體的 PV/nRT 不一定等於 1","(D) 真實氣體分子量愈大，通常沸點愈高、愈容易液化","(E) 在 0 K 時理想氣體仍然具有體積"],"answer":"(A)(C)(D)","explanation":"(A) 對。理想氣體粒子間沒有作用力，無法液化，(B) 錯。真實氣體 Z = PV/nRT 不一定為 1，(C) 對。分子量大、引力大、沸點高、容易液化，(D) 對。理想氣體在 0 K 時沒有體積，(E) 錯；講義的比較表寫的是真實氣體才具有體積。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":72,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"理想氣體與真實氣體","difficulty":"中","section":"2-3 理想氣體","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 補充單元 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q27","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"27","type":"single_choice","question":"定壓下，開口容器中的空氣由 27°C 加熱到 177°C，容器內原有空氣逸出的百分比約為多少？","options":["33.3%","50%","66.7%","150%"],"answer":"33.3%","explanation":"T₁ = 300 K、T₂ = 450 K。逸出率 = (T₂ − T₁)/T₂ = 150/450 ≈ 33.3%。50% 是膨脹率 (T₂ − T₁)/T₁，分母不同，不要混用。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":62,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"查理定律的應用","difficulty":"中","section":"2-2 氣體的基本定律","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 補充單元 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"},{"id":"tm_108_q28","materialId":"tm_108","questionNumber":"28","type":"single_choice","question":"同溫下，He 與 O₂ 的氣體分子平均動能比，以及平均運動速率比（He：O₂）分別為何？","options":["1：1、2√2：1","1：8、8：1","1：1、1：2√2","8：1、1：1"],"answer":"1：1、2√2：1","explanation":"平均動能 Ēₖ = (3/2)RT 只與溫度有關，同溫下比值為 1：1。速率 v = √(3RT/M)，v(He)：v(O₂) = √(32/4) = 2√2：1。分子量小的跑得快。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":54,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-11-06T00:00:00Z","knowledgePoint":"氣體動力論","difficulty":"難","section":"2-1 氣體的性質","reference":"AI 自編（非講義原題、非段考原題），依易錯題型 補充單元 命題；數值答案經 source/build-review.py 驗算"}]};
